url: https://github.com/poplolioi11/bodleian-sinica1634-yiguan-lueshu-1874
abstract: Version 0.2.0 compares independent observations with the frozen initial
  transcription, followed by non-blind source adjudication of 42 target physical faces.
  Of 11 full-frame Gemini jobs, ten succeeded and one failed; only bounded native
  body observations from that failed job were accepted, without upgrading its failed/incomplete
  audit status. Separate source-only margin, paragraph and corrected-crop supplements
  are disclosed. The dataset contains 434 original-print units plus two modern descriptions,
  with 158 changed unit strings, 69 text uncertainties and 40 reviewed source-edge
  regions of unknown missing-stroke extent. These are not error or accuracy estimates.
  No human double collation, expert review, peer review or measured accuracy is claimed.
